@bank all
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M17 the lift roof (24s; seat E4, after head writer W2 retired, in W2's style). Texts said by nobody
// except works.ask.m17 (Halloran's Mail, "Subject | body", unsigned; {time} {place}). roof.shut replaces W2's roof.held
// ("Stairs, please." has crew use the ladder, which the design rules out; the lead's call): 24s reads roof.shut.
== roof.card
- Lift hour. Ride the roof down the spine and grease each guide?
== roof.up
- Hatch up, harness clipped. You're on the roof.
== roof.free
- Half four. The lift's back in service.
== roof.shut
- The lift is held for maintenance until 16:30. Everyone waits, even you.
== works.ask.m17
- The lift roof | Thursday is lift day. Meet me at the lift, {place}, at {time}. Bring your gloves.
